[LevelSummary]
Title="Metallurgy"
; EN: Description="Separating the fast from the slow, the strong from the weak, the skilled from the incompetent - Metallurgy will test your mettle."
Description="Metallurgy scheidt de snellen van de trage, de sterken van de zwakken, de bekwamen van de onkundigen - hier wordt je karakter gesmeed."

